+## Simplify the system boundary
+
+Put unavoidable complexity behind one clear owner. Remove the adapters, parallel
+paths, and support work that the stronger boundary makes unnecessary. Judge the
+whole system, not one component's line count.
+
+`examples.md` contains the Raptor precedent and its sources. A precedent can guide
+attention, but it cannot supply missing repository facts.
